    {
        "content": "<p>Interesting that the metadata for a RAiD can change over time. People can be added to projects, for example.</p>",
        "id": 635659346,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin 🚀",
        "timestamp": 1793186664
    },
    {
        "content": "<p>RAiDs can be stored by Orcid so maybe we should let people pull in new information that's associated with their Orcid from time to time.</p>",
        "id": 635661718,
        "sender_full_name": "Philip Durbin 🚀",
        "timestamp": 1793187277
    },
    {
        "content": "<p><a href=\"https://docs.api.raid.org\">https://docs.api.raid.org</a></p>",
